Package: n5-fangov
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: lm-sensors, systemd
Recommends: smartmontools
Suggests: minisforum-n5-it5571-dkms (>= 0.2.1+sr1~rc1)
Conflicts: n5-fand
Maintainer: SirRenix <sirrenix@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/SirRenix/n5-fangov
Description: guarded fan control for Proxmox VE and Debian
 Single static daemon that regulates hwmon pwm channels from temperature
 curves with slew limiting, critical override, stall detection, read-back
 verification and a profile-defined safe state on stop. The n5pro profile
 drives the Minisforum N5 Pro EC (IT5571) through the minisforum_n5_it5571
 driver (package minisforum-n5-it5571-dkms, suggested; install it only on the
 N5 Pro); its hardware status per
 board, BIOS and EC firmware is shown by `n5-fangov identify`. Generic
 NCT67xx and IT87xx profiles ship untested. Includes CLI, HTTP API and web UI.
